{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xeno's Adventure is a run and gun action game with focus on boss fights and harder difficulty. You will explore different worlds, battle mind controlled monsters and bosses, all in a drawn 2D Pixel Art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Xeno as you traverse different worlds, upgrade your stats, learn powerful skills, while you try to save all worlds from the antagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xeno's Adventure includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Worlds to explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Platformer Levels\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Shops (Unlock Skills, Upgrade Skills &amp; Upgrade your Character's Stats)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 different monsters (4 different types of enemies for example &quot;Range Attack Enemy&quot;)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the skill of the player, it will take you 6 to 10 hours of playtime, to finish the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895000?t=1757771237","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895000?t=1757771237","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895000/405a78d395d99a7e29fdab294bee1c879a18e266/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757771237","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895000/405a78d395d99a7e29fdab294bee1c879a18e266/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757771237","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable witho